{"4143780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Noelle", "steam_appid": 4143780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting winter journey where memory, fear, and survival interlock. You are Noelle. After a car crash in a furious snowstorm, you wake up alone and cold, not knowing where you are. Walk between fading fires and hear the whispers of long lost voices. You must navigate through frozen memories, each step in the snow revealing a truth buried beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without the warmth of a fire, Noelle's story ends forever. As the storm intensifies, every ember of warmth becomes a fragile symbol of hope and what is lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143780/extras/eb46ea483fa451fae88dc8920f29aec8.poster.avif?t=1767795616\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143780/extras/eb46ea483fa451fae88dc8920f29aec8.webm?t=1767795616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional, story-driven exploration:</strong> Experience a grounded, psychological narrative, brought to life through immersive environments and subtle details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbolic survival mechanics:</strong> Keep the fire alive to uncover memories, confront guilt, and piece together Noelle's fragmented memories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric world-building:</strong> Snow-covered cabins, frozen churches, and echoes of tales lost to time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haunting audio design:</strong> Whispers, ambient soundscapes, and music that shift with the enviroment and Noelle's state of mind. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, impactful experience:</strong> Designed to be played in one sitting, leaving an emotional imprint long after the credits have faded.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143780/extras/e96dc99523185e416fafab1d75400236.poster.avif?t=1767795616\" width=602 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143780/extras/e96dc99523185e416fafab1d75400236.webm?t=1767795616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Noelle is a narrative exploration game thats blends horror, environmental storytelling, and symbolic survival. It invites players who seek emotion over action, and atmosphere over combat. Find warmth. Face your memories. Find your way home or freeze to death in the ongoing storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143780/extras/6754a7af8e3556742c04a5fe3d6219d4.poster.avif?t=1767795616\" width=616 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143780/extras/6754a7af8e3556742c04a5fe3d6219d4.webm?t=1767795616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting winter journey where memory, fear, and survival interlock. You are Noelle. After a car crash in a furious snowstorm, you wake up alone and cold, not knowing where you are. Walk between fading fires and hear the whispers of long lost voices. You must navigate through frozen memories, each step in the snow revealing a truth buried beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without the warmth of a fire, Noelle's story ends forever. As the storm intensifies, every ember of warmth becomes a fragile symbol of hope and what is lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143780/extras/eb46ea483fa451fae88dc8920f29aec8.poster.avif?t=1767795616\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143780/extras/eb46ea483fa451fae88dc8920f29aec8.webm?t=1767795616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional, story-driven exploration:</strong> Experience a grounded, psychological narrative, brought to life through immersive environments and subtle details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbolic survival mechanics:</strong> Keep the fire alive to uncover memories, confront guilt, and piece together Noelle's fragmented memories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric world-building:</strong> Snow-covered cabins, frozen churches, and echoes of tales lost to time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haunting audio design:</strong> Whispers, ambient soundscapes, and music that shift with the enviroment and Noelle's state of mind. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, impactful experience:</strong> Designed to be played in one sitting, leaving an emotional imprint long after the credits have faded.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.